kbr:MappingBuktiCTLEXT001 kbr:controlAction kbr:PenggunaanVarietasTahan ;
    kbr:knowledgeType "mapping" ;
    kbr:sourceId "Control > Resistant Varieties" ;
    kbr:sourceText "the most reliable control measure is to use desired anthracnose resistant varieties particularly in localities with high cad pressures." .

kbr:MappingBuktiCTLEXT002 kbr:controlAction kbr:SanitasiLahan ;
    kbr:knowledgeType "mapping" ;
    kbr:sourceId "Control > Farm Sanitation" ;
    kbr:sourceText "stems and leaves from infected plants after harvest must be destroyed by burning to reduce the amount of fungal spores and other infective structures that can cause infections in the next generation of plants." .

