    kbr:knowledgeType "mapping" ;
    kbr:sourceId "Environmental conditions, paragraph 1" ;
    kbr:sourceText "bacterial wilt of potato is generally favoured by temperatures between 25°c and 37°c. it usually doesn't cause problems in areas where mean soil temperature is below 15°c." .

